AltoRewardsDistributor::withdrawContractTokens
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when contract has no tokens to withdraw
    │   └── it should revert (from SafeERC20)
    └── when contract has tokens to withdraw
        ├── when withdrawing payment tokens
        │   ├── it should transfer tokens to msg.sender (owner)
        │   └── it should emit WithdrawContractTokens event
        ├── when withdrawing reward tokens
        │   ├── it should transfer tokens to msg.sender (owner)
        │   └── it should emit WithdrawContractTokens event
        ├── when withdrawing partial amount
        │   ├── it should transfer partial tokens to msg.sender (owner)
        │   └── it should emit WithdrawContractTokens event
        └── when withdrawing different token types
            ├── it should transfer tokens to msg.sender (owner)
            └── it should emit WithdrawContractTokens event
